{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/tuikit\/keyboardshortcuts"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Guides","generated":true,"title":"Guides","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StateManagement","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ThemingGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusSystem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/AppearanceAndColors","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Preferences","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/CustomViews","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PaletteReference","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ListAndTable","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/LayoutSystem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageDecoding"]}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Input-Types","title":"Input Types","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Key","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyEvent","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/QuitBehavior"]},{"anchor":"Focus","title":"Focus","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusState","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Focusable"]},{"anchor":"Status-Bar","title":"Status Bar","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBar","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarItem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarItemProtocol","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Shortcut"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyboardShortcuts"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"TUIkit uses a layered event dispatch system. When a key is pressed, it passes through up to five layers. The first layer that consumes the event wins: remaining layers are skipped. Layer 0 (text input) and Layer 3 (focus system) are mutually exclusive: when a text input element is focused, Layer 0 runs and Layer 3 is skipped.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"keyboard-event-dispatch.png"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Additionally, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Ctrl+C"},{"type":"text","text":" (SIGINT) is handled at the OS signal level "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"before"}]},{"type":"text","text":" any of these layers: it always terminates the application."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Available Keys","type":"heading","anchor":"Available-Keys","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Key","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" enum defines all keys that TUIkit can recognize from terminal input:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Character Keys","type":"heading","anchor":"Character-Keys","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Any printable character is represented as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".character(Character)"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":[".onKeyPress(Key.from(\"x\")) {","    \/\/ handle \"x\" key","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Uppercase detection: when a capital letter is typed, the resulting "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyEvent","isActive":true},{"text":" has ","type":"text"},{"code":"shift: true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" set automatically.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Special Keys","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Special-Keys"},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Key","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".escape","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Escape key","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".enter","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Enter \/ Return","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".tab"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tab"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".backspace"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Backspace \/ Delete backward","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".delete","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Forward delete","type":"text"}]}]]]},{"text":"Arrow Keys","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Arrow-Keys"},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".up","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow up"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".down","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow down"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".left"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Arrow left","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".right","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Arrow right","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"text":"Navigation Keys","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Navigation-Keys"},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Description","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".home"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Home"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".end"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"End"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".pageUp"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Page Up","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".pageDown","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Page Down","type":"text"}]}]]]},{"text":"Key Events and Modifiers","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Key-Events-and-Modifiers"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyEvent"},{"text":" combines a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Key"},{"text":" with modifier flags:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["public struct KeyEvent {","    public let key: Key","    public let ctrl: Bool     \/\/ Ctrl modifier","    public let alt: Bool      \/\/ Alt \/ Option modifier","    public let shift: Bool    \/\/ Shift modifier","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The terminal encodes modifiers differently from GUI frameworks:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Ctrl+letter","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Detected from ASCII control codes (0x01–0x1A). For example, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Ctrl+C"},{"type":"text","text":" produces byte "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0x03"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Alt+key"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Detected from ESC prefix sequences ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ESC"},{"type":"text","text":" followed by the key byte)."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Shift","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Only auto-detected for uppercase letters. The terminal does not send distinct shift codes for most keys.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Registering Key Handlers","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Registering-Key-Handlers"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".onKeyPress()"},{"type":"text","text":" modifier to handle keyboard events in your views:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Handle All Keys","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Handle-All-Keys"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["Text(\"Press any key\")","    .onKeyPress { event in","        if event.key == .enter {","            doSomething()","            return true   \/\/ consumed: stops propagation","        }","        return false      \/\/ not consumed: passes to next handler","    }"]},{"text":"Handle Specific Keys","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Handle-Specific-Keys"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["Text(\"Use arrow keys\")","    .onKeyPress(keys: [.up, .down]) { event in","        if event.key == .up { moveUp() }","        else { moveDown() }","        return true","    }"]},{"text":"Handle a Single Key","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Handle-a-Single-Key"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The single-key variant always consumes the event:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["Text(\"Press Enter to continue\")","    .onKeyPress(.enter) {","        continueAction()","    }"]},{"text":"Handler Priority","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Handler-Priority"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Handlers are dispatched in "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"reverse registration order"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the deepest view in the tree (most recently registered) gets the event first. This means inner views can intercept events before outer views see them."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["VStack {","    Text(\"Outer\")","        .onKeyPress(.enter) {","            \/\/ Only reached if inner handler did NOT consume it","            print(\"outer enter\")","        }","    Text(\"Inner\")","        .onKeyPress(.enter) {","            \/\/ Gets the event FIRST","            print(\"inner enter\")","        }","}"]},{"name":"Important","type":"aside","style":"important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All key handlers are re-registered every render frame. If a view is not rendered (e.g. behind a conditional), its handlers are not active."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"text":"Focus Navigation","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Focus-Navigation"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"FocusManager","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" dispatches key events in three steps:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Focused element delegation"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": the focused element’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"handleKeyEvent(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is called first. If it consumes the event, dispatch stops.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tab \/ Shift+Tab"}]},{"type":"text","text":": cycles focus between elements (wraps around)."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Arrow key fallback","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Up\/Left move to the previous element in the section, Down\/Right move to the next. This only triggers if the focused element did not consume the arrow key in step 1.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Key","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Action"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Tab","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Move focus to the next focusable element (wraps around)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Shift+Tab","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Move focus to the previous focusable element (wraps around)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Up \/ Left"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Move to previous element in section (fallback)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Down \/ Right"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Move to next element in section (fallback)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For more details, see ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusSystem","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Default Bindings","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Default-Bindings"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Layer 4 provides three built-in key bindings that work without any configuration:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Key","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Action"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Condition","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Q"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Quit application","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Only when "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/QuitBehavior","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" allows it"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"t"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"T"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cycle to next color theme"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Only when theme cycling is enabled","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"a","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"A","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Cycle to next appearance","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Always active","type":"text"}]}]]]},{"text":"Quit Behavior","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Quit-Behavior"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/QuitBehavior","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" enum controls when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"},{"type":"text","text":" is allowed to quit:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Value","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Behavior","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".always","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"},{"type":"text","text":" quits from any screen (default)"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".rootOnly"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" only quits when no status bar context is pushed"}]}]]]},{"inlineContent":[{"code":".rootOnly","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is useful for modal dialogs: push a status bar context for the dialog, and ","type":"text"},{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" will be blocked until the user dismisses it:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["Dialog(title: \"Confirm\") {","    Text(\"Are you sure?\")","} footer: {","    ButtonRow {","        Button(\"Yes\") { confirm() }","        Button(\"No\") { cancel() }","    }","}",".statusBarItems(context: \"confirm-dialog\") {","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"y\", label: \"yes\")","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"n\", label: \"no\")","}"]},{"text":"Changing the built-in quit key","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Changing-the-built-in-quit-key"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The default quit binding is configurable through ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarState\/quitShortcut"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["@Environment(\\.statusBar) private var statusBar","","statusBar.quitShortcut = .escape","statusBar.quitShortcut = .ctrlQ","statusBar.quitShortcut = QuitShortcut(","    key: .f12,","    shortcutSymbol: Shortcut.f12,","    label: \"exit\"",")"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This changes both the Layer 4 quit binding and the displayed system item."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Overriding `q` in a local view context","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Overriding-q-in-a-local-view-context"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A user-defined status bar item with shortcut "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"},{"type":"text","text":" and an action intercepts the key before the default quit binding runs:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["EditorView()","    .statusBarItems {","        StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"q\", label: \"close\") {","            dismissEditor()","        }","    }"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the correct way to repurpose "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"},{"type":"text","text":" for a specific screen, dialog, or focus section. The matching user item handles the event in Layer 1, so Layer 4’s built-in quit binding is never reached."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Status Bar Shortcuts","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Status-Bar-Shortcuts"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The status bar displays available shortcuts to the user. Use the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Shortcut","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" namespace for consistent, platform-standard symbols:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Display Symbols","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Display-Symbols"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":[".statusBarItems {","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.arrowsUpDown, label: \"nav\")","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.enter, label: \"select\", key: .enter)","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.escape, label: \"back\")","}"]},{"text":"Common Symbols","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Common-Symbols"},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Symbol"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Constant","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Description","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⎋"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.escape"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Escape"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"↵"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.enter","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Enter","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"⇥","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.tab"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tab"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"⇤","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.shiftTab","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Shift+Tab"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⌫"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.backspace"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Backspace"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"⌦","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.delete","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Delete","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"␣"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.space","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Space"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"↑"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.arrowUp","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow up"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"↓"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.arrowDown","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow down"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"←"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.arrowLeft","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow left"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"→"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.arrowRight","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow right"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"↑↓"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.arrowsUpDown","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Vertical arrows"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"←→","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.arrowsLeftRight"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Horizontal arrows"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"↑↓←→"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.arrowsAll","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All arrows"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⌃"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.control"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Control modifier","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⇧"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.shift"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Shift modifier","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"⌥","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.option"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Option \/ Alt","type":"text"}]}]]]},{"anchor":"Shortcut-Helpers","type":"heading","text":"Shortcut Helpers","level":3},{"code":["\/\/ Combine modifier + key: \"⌃c\"","Shortcut.combine(.control, \"c\")","","\/\/ Ctrl+key display: \"^c\"","Shortcut.ctrl(\"c\")","","\/\/ Range display: \"1-9\"","Shortcut.range(\"1\", \"9\")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Common-Shortcut-Letters","type":"heading","text":"Common Shortcut Letters","level":3},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Constant"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Value","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.quit","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.yes","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"y","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.no","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"n"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.cancel","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"c","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.ok","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"o"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"anchor":"Automatic-Key-Matching","type":"heading","text":"Automatic Key Matching","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarItem","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" automatically derives the trigger key from the shortcut string when no explicit "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"key:"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter is given:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Symbol shortcuts ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⎋"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"↵"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⇥"},{"type":"text","text":") map to their corresponding "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Key","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" values"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Single-character shortcuts ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"q\""},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"y\""},{"type":"text","text":") map to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".character(thatChar)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow combinations ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"↑↓\""},{"type":"text","text":") match "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"both"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" individual arrow keys"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Multi-character non-symbol strings are informational only (no trigger key)","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"code":["\/\/ Automatic: shortcut \"q\" triggers on Key.character(\"q\")","StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"q\", label: \"quit\") { quit() }","","\/\/ Explicit: override the trigger key","StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.enter, label: \"select\", key: .enter) { select() }","","\/\/ Informational: no action, no trigger","StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.arrowsUpDown, label: \"nav\")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Status-Bar-Context-Stack","type":"heading","text":"Status Bar Context Stack","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The status bar supports a context stack for temporary shortcut overrides: useful for modals and nested navigation:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/ Set global items",".statusBarItems {","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.arrowsUpDown, label: \"nav\")","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.enter, label: \"select\", key: .enter)","}","","\/\/ Push context-specific items (e.g. for a dialog)",".statusBarItems(context: \"my-dialog\") {","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"y\", label: \"yes\") { confirm() }","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"n\", label: \"no\") { cancel() }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When a context is pushed, its items replace the global items in the display. System items (quit, theme, appearance) remain visible unless a user item uses the same shortcut string."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"System-Items","type":"heading","text":"System Items","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Three system items are shown by default:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Shortcut","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Label"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent"